## Coding Standards
- Strict TypeScript, no `any`; zod validation for all inputs and all
  external API responses
- Server Components by default; client components only when needed
- Server Actions for simple CRUD in apps/web; apps/api for
  integrations, jobs, credentials and PDF
- Small focused modules; adapters per provider
- Vitest tests: RAG status logic (incl. restarts), metric aggregation,
  uptime calc, release tracking (branch compare), report aggregation,
  encryption
- Store dates in UTC, display in Europe/London
- Ask before adding dependencies outside this stack
- After each step: summarise what was built, what to test manually,
  and any env vars/setup needed

